    "bulletPoints": [
      "FlexZone Drawer: The FlexZone Drawer is customizable with 5 different temperature settings - From refrigerator to soft freeze, this middle drawer can store everything from fruit and vegetables to your favorite meat and seafood",
      "Beverage Center:  Quick access to refreshingly cool, filtered water two ways; choose from an internal dispenser or a built-in pitcher that automatically refills, with the option to infuse with a flavor",
